"``item_value_no_plus``: the value of clicked item, URL-encoded. Special "
"characters are escaped to make them valid in URLs and spaces are replaced by"
" the ``%20``, not plus."
msgstr "``item_value_no_plus``: vrednost kliknute stavke, URL-kodirana. Specijalni karakteri su izbegnuti kako bi bili validni u URL-ovima, a razmaci su zamenjeni sa ``%20``, a ne plusom."

